# D-mealz — Eat. Share. Care.

Campus food-waste app. Students vote on next week's menu; the dining admin
records leftovers and alerts orphanages, NGOs and cattle farms; partners
accept pickups; donors and institutions can message in.

    d-mealz-project/
      frontend/   static site (HTML + CSS + JS + images)
      backend/    Supabase schema (Postgres + Realtime)

Quick start: run `backend/supabase/schema.sql` in a new Supabase project,
paste the URL and anon key into `frontend/js/config.js`, then host `frontend/`.